from pathlib import Path
import json,re,html
U=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
pit=json.loads((U/'qa/pit-surfaces.json').read_text())['reports']
weekend=json.loads((U/'qa/weekend-core.json').read_text())
samples=sum(p['samples'] for p in pit)
section=f'''<!-- pit-surface-update-start --><h2>Pit routes, terrain and sponsor artwork — 23 October</h2>
<p>All twelve pit routes now use tangent-continuous interpolation, height sampled at their actual ground positions and connected road cross-sections. Interlagos received a longer vertical transition; its maximum modeled pit grade fell from about 33% to 11.3%. This is a game reconstruction, not a surveyed gradient claim. Yas Marina includes a separated underground exit section based on the mapped route; tunnel clearance and vertical ramps are estimated.</p>
<p>The final automated pit check sampled {samples:,} positions across all twelve circuits, with no missing pit floor or overlapping ground surfaces detected in that sample. Sponsor texture proportions passed on every circuit. The qualifying/race core regression passed {weekend['checks']:,} checks, including AI pit service, classification and pit speed limiting. The packaged compatibility desktop app launched, loaded MR 26 and Interlagos and accelerated without renderer Node integration.</p>
<p>Ground clipping now preserves UVs, normals and colours and handles vertices exactly on a clipping edge. Degenerate terrain triangles are rejected. Runoff defaults to grass where appropriate, with mapped gravel and paved areas. Near-track mapped sand at Monza, Silverstone and Suzuka is interpreted as gravel where circuit references support that use; this remains a classification inference. Gravel uses the CC0 <a href="https://polyhaven.com/a/gravel_floor">Poly Haven gravel_floor</a> material with colour, normal and roughness detail.</p>
<p>All six partners keep equal rotation through the sponsor allocation. Logos are fitted to physical board proportions and repeated across long banners instead of stretched. Higher-quality matching artwork was selected for STEM Racing, NPE and Axis. Clean supplied artwork was retained for Hustle Hive, Brinda’s and Enermax where an online alternative was worse or could not be verified.</p>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://stemracing.com.sg/">STEM Racing Singapore</a>, <a href="https://hustlehive.ai/">Hustle Hive</a>, <a href="https://www.brindas.com.sg/">Brinda’s</a>, <a href="https://npeprint.com/about-our-printing-company">NPE</a>, <a href="https://freightcue.com/companies/india/ludhiana-axis-container-lines-ludhiana-head-office-dc6a16">matching Axis Container Lines artwork</a>. Enermax Synergy SEA’s replacement artwork remains unverified, so its supplied mark is preserved. Selection evidence and hashes are in <code>assets/sponsors/manifest.json</code>.</p>
<p>Runoff references include <a href="https://www.spa-francorchamps.be/en/news/258_2022-a-season-turned-to-the-future-both-on-and-off-the-track">Spa’s official 2022 works</a> and <a href="https://www.formula1.com/en/latest/article/explained-how-key-changes-to-the-red-bull-ring-look-to-avoid-last-years.2ubjMYkbT3HHpwuEJ7PoHw.2ubjMYkbT3HHpwuEJ7PoHw">the Red Bull Ring’s gravel changes</a>. Team sponsor mats are an original Milano event treatment; they do not reproduce the real circuit’s commercial contracts. These fixes do not establish that every location or visual angle is defect-free.</p><!-- pit-surface-update-end -->'''
p=U/'docs/Validation.html';text=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8');text=re.sub(r'<!-- pit-surface-update-start -->.*?<!-- pit-surface-update-end -->','',text,flags=re.S);text=text.replace('<h2>Reports</h2>',section+'<h2>Reports</h2>');p.write_text(text,encoding='utf-8')
notice=U/'licenses/NOTICE.txt';text=notice.read_text();marker='\nSPONSOR ARTWORK UPDATE\n';text=text.split(marker)[0]+marker+'''STEM Racing Singapore: https://stemracing.com.sg/ (official logo asset; embedded raster extracted without redesign).
NPE Print: https://npeprint.com/about-our-printing-company (official transparent artwork).
Axis Container Lines: matching supplied ship/globe/plane mark from https://freightcue.com/companies/india/ludhiana-axis-container-lines-ludhiana-head-office-dc6a16 . This is a directory source, not a claim of endorsement.
Hustle Hive, Brinda's and Enermax Synergy SEA: supplied artwork retained. Matching online identity does not establish a licence for unrelated logos. Sponsor artwork remains its owners' property.
Additional gravel PBR: https://polyhaven.com/a/gravel_floor , CC0; resized for real-time use.
''';notice.write_text(text)
print('Updated pit, surface and sponsor validation with source links.')
